| Color Key | Global Context (Home, Movies, Series) | Search Context (`#view-search`) | Player Context (`#view-player`) |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Red (403)** | Quick Jump to `#view-search` | Trigger `CLEAR` (Clear query) | Toggle Subtitles (`#osd-subtitles-btn`) |
